# 🚀 GentleQuest Launch Control

> **Status:** 🟡 PRE-FLIGHT
> **Target:** Production Release (v1.0)
> **Date:** 2026-01-08

---

## 📋 Pre-Flight Checklist

### 1. Infrastructure & Connectivity
- [ ] **DNS & SSL**: Verify `ai-mental-health-assistant.onrender.com` resolves and is secure.
- [ ] **Database**: Verify SQLite/Postgres connection.
- [ ] **Redis**: Verify Redis connection (Session Store).
- [ ] **Cold Start**: Verify app wakes up successfully (Timeout adjusted?).

### 2. Core User Flows (Smoke Tests)
- [ ] **Landing Page**: Loads successfully (Status 200).
- [ ] **API Health**: `/api/health` returns OK.
- [ ] **Chat Interface**: Can send/receive messages.
- [ ] **History**: Can retrieve past sessions.

### 3. Critical Integrations
- [ ] **LLM Provider**: Verify Gemini API connectivity.
- [ ] **Safety Layer**: Verify content filtering is active.

### 4. Application Logic
- [ ] **Session Management**: Users remain logged in.
- [ ] **Onboarding**: New users flow works.

---

## 🛑 Blockers & Risks
- **Render Cold Start**: Free tier sleep timeout triggers false positives in monitoring.
- **LLM Migration**: Backend currently uses legacy `google.generativeai`.

---

